pet-whale README · Install：In the profile directory you are using (the desktop app and the web UI each have their own; for the web UI it is usually `~/.dsh/profiles/web`), add the dependency and the bundle to `package.json`:

```json
{
  "dependencies": { "pet-whale": "^1.2.7" },
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["...existing...", "pet-whale"] } }
}

Then run `pnpm install` in that directory and restart DSH. For the desktop app, quit from the tray and reopen it.

